OL,3,CPedestrian dies after being hit by
OL,4,Cmultiple vehicles including a police
OL,5,Ccar
OL,7,FA pedestrian has died after being hit
OL,8,Fby serval vehicles, including a police
OL,9,Fcar, after a major crash in Carmarthen.
OL,11,FDyfed-Powys Police were called after a
OL,12,Fperson was seen on the A40 near the
OL,13,FAbergwili roundabout on the evening of
OL,14,F28 July.
OL,16,FThe force said it is now investigating
OL,17,Fa six-vehicle collision.
OL,19,FThe pedestrian was pronounced dead at
OL,20,Fthe scene and enquiries to identify
OL,21,Fthem are underway.
