OL,3,CPedestrian dies after being hit by
OL,4,Cmultiple vehicles including a police
OL,5,Ccar
OL,7,FThe road is still closed and expected
OL,8,Fto remain closed throughout today (29
OL,9,FJuly).
OL,11,FNo arrests have been made in
OL,12,Fconnection with the incident and the
OL,13,Fforce has referred itself to the
OL,14,FIndependent Office of Police Conduct
OL,15,F(IOPC).
OL,17,FAnyone with dashcam footage or further
OL,18,Finformation has been asked to speak to
OL,19,Finvestigating officers.
